{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>So</b> — behold, I reckon in my heart and see You. The meaning is as though I were in the Sanctuary and I see Your strength, which is the Ark, as in: \"and give to Your steadfast one strength.\"" "<b>And Your glory</b> — the Shekhinah."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 63, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:34.526138142Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}